{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜黃仁勳辭職　英偉達股價一度急跌逾一成／瑪麗醫院升降機報告點名建築署機電署有缺失\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-NVIDIA-FOLO-261113A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月13日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【黃仁勳辭職】捲入婚外情和間諜風波的黃仁勳辭去英偉達行政總裁一職。受事件影響，英偉達股價一度急跌逾一成。</p><p>【點名部門缺失】瑪麗醫院升降機運作問題調查報告，建築署、機電署遭點名有缺失。</p><p>【南韓男團主題】維港上空上演南韓男團BIGBANG主題無人機表演，為演唱會打響頭炮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.278565+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:02:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.147398+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:46.225618+00:00","content_hash":"74561d42764f7a5b6d686edf3fbfaa8f2c3b7b14838131c5f45ef48eeabbe95d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.278565+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}